ITEM 6 - THE R4 APPROVAL PATH: YES, there is an open question.
=====================================================================
What the code does: scripts/veritas_gate.py:190-196
    def human_approval_present() -> bool:
        """R3/R4 sign-off: VERITAS_APPROVAL (spec) or VERITAS_HUMAN_APPROVAL."""
        for var in ("VERITAS_APPROVAL", "VERITAS_HUMAN_APPROVAL"):
            if os.environ.get(var, "").strip():
                return True
        return False
It returns a boolean and is never passed to log_audit_event().

Is the approval in the audit log?  NO.
$ grep -c 'VERITAS_HUMAN_APPROVAL' .agent-pipeline/audit/veritas_audit.jsonl
